    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=v1hRshZVFStCdKw4]], one Medium or Small creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 5 feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target is pulled into the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s space and becomes grafted to its body. The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can have only one target grafted at a time. While grafted, the target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition and Disadvantage on Constitution saving throws. When the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} moves, the grafted target moves with it. If the target dies while grafted, its body is destroyed, and the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} regains 10 Hit Points. The grafted target or a creature within 5 feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can take an action to make a DC 15 Strength (Athletics) check. On a successful check, the target is no longer grafted and moves to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}.</p>",
